WEBVTT

NOTE
Captions of "Commissioning and assurance: from the campus to one check, and back". The film is silent: these are the words shown on screen, one per step, written by the recorder
(scripts/media/record-product-film.mjs) above the demonstration; each step was verified by its proof before its words appeared.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.620
Commissioning: every room on the campus, and what needs attention.

2
00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:06.190
Drill down: one room, through its phases.

3
00:00:06.190 --> 00:00:09.530
Every check, with its evidence and who ran it.

4
00:00:09.530 --> 00:00:12.500
Traceability: from the requirement to the test that proves it.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.480
The room’s deficiencies, each with an owner.

6
00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:19.010
Assurance: the room in its four states.

7
00:00:19.010 --> 00:00:22.970
Run the checks again, on a simulated system: a simulation never proves commissioning.

8
00:00:22.970 --> 00:00:26.110
Back up: every open deficiency across the campus,

9
00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:30.090
grouped by who owns the fix.

10
00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:33.320
Designed, commissioned, current and proposed, never confused.
